#: title
msgid "IoT Community "
msgstr ""

#: description
msgctxt "description"
msgid "Join a community of users and contributors focused on Fedora IoT."
msgstr ""

#: header-%3Etitle
msgid "Community"
msgstr ""

#: header-%3Esubtitle
msgctxt "header->subtitle"
msgid "Join a community of users and contributors focused on Fedora IoT."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Fedora IoT is created by a team in the Fedora Project community called the "
"IoT Working Group. It is comprised of official members who have decision-"
"making powers, as well as other contributors. Learn more about this group "
"and how you can get involved on the IoT Working Group website."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgctxt "section->[0]->header->sectionTitle"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Forum"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"The Fedora IoT tag on Fedora's Discourse-based discussion forum is a great "
"place to connect with other Fedora Workstation users and contributors."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Chat"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"You can chat with the Fedora IoT Working Group via either Matrix or IRC: "
"#iot:fedoraproject.org on Matrix and #fedora-iot on irc.libera.chat."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Mailing List"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[2]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"The Fedora IoT Working Group sends meeting agendas and minutes and has "
"discussions on their mailing list at iot@lists.fedoraproject.org."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Become a Fedora contributor\n"
"\n"
"Your friendly and helpful contributions to these communication channels "
"would be greatly appreciated! Learn more."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Communication channels"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Ways to get involved"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Report & discuss issues"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[0]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"You can view, file, and discuss Fedora IoT issues on the Fedora IoT issue "
"tracker."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Attend a meeting"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[2]-%3Econtent-%3Ecard-%3E[1]-%3Esubtitle
msgid ""
"IoT Working Group meetings are open to all current and potential "
"contributors on Wednesdays, 11 AM US Eastern at fedora-meeting@irc.libera."
"chat."
msgstr ""
